@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "诊疗助理" as A0
boundary "<u>:诊疗助理接口</u>" as B0
actor "牙医" as A1
boundary "<u>:牙医接口</u>" as B1
control "<u>:管理影像与诊疗</u>\n<u>文书控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:患者</u>" as Patient
participant "<u>:诊疗文件</u>" as Document
participant "<u>:文件版本</u>" as FileVersion
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-23办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-23办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Patient : 核对临床访问(牙医或获准助理、对象范围)
activate Patient
Patient --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Patient
K -> Document : 接收原件版本(患者、来源、归属、文件)
activate Document
Document -> FileVersion : 核对原件完整性(格式、大小和校验依据)
activate FileVersion
FileVersion --> Document : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate FileVersion
Document --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Document
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
A1 -> B1 : 确认上传文件及归属
activate B1
B1 -> B1 : 检查输入格式()
B1 -> K : 协调UC-23办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Document : 确认文件依据(牙医核实结果及关联对象)
activate Document
Document -> FileVersion : 保留确认原件(人员时间、版本及代理依据)
activate FileVersion
FileVersion --> Document : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate FileVersion
Document --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Document
end
K --> B1 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B1 --> A1 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B1
note over K,FileVersion
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
